  "body": "Unfortunately you have to use some \"tricks\" to show a placeholder for a date input field.\r\nThe current behavior only shows date blank in the format used by the browser.\r\n\r\nIt would be nice if you could use the value / placeholder attributes to pre-fill the field.\r\nLooks nicer and allows the user (and webdev) to save time.\r\n\r\nBonus if you could specify \"today\" as valid value.\r\n\r\nCheers Faul",
